  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.10.0 - AM041 Accuracy & Fix Safety\n\n            🛡️ Analyzer Improvements (AM041):\n            - Suppressed false positives for non-AutoMapper CreateMap symbols\n            - Added candidate-symbol fallback for robust symbol resolution in duplicate checks\n\n            🔧 Code Fix Improvements (AM041):\n            - Duplicate CreateMap<TSource, TDestination>().ReverseMap() now rewrites to CreateMap<TDestination, TSource>()\n            - Preserves reverse-direction mapping coverage instead of removing the full statement\n\n            ✅ Validation:\n            - Added regression tests for non-AutoMapper CreateMap and member-access reverse-map rewrite paths\n            - All 448 tests passing locally (436 passed, 12 skipped)\n\n            Previous Release: v2.9.0 - Analyzer Accuracy & Contradiction Fixes",
